Orbify: signed firmware updates (docs/design/release-signing.md). The release parser reads each
firmware asset's "orbify_signature" from the feed; once the staged image matches its SHA-256, the
updater checks that a release key the root certified signed (tag, asset, SHA-256)
(orbify/core/UpdateSignature). Until shared/release-signing.json enforces it, a missing or bad
signature is logged and the update installs. Switch ORBIFY_OTA_SIGNATURE (tailnet_build.py).
Host tests: xteink/test/update_signature_test.cpp, ota_signature_test.cpp.

